New in this build:
- Setup is now tiles: PCT or Academy, your level, your date and weight.
- Test day guides each test:
  - Prone bridge: a 90 second hold, Hayden calls the time.
  - Push-ups: down on the low beep, up on the high beep, Hayden counts to 25.
  - Illinois run: 3, 2, 1, go, with the 20 second mark.
  - Vertical jump: hold the phone to your chest and jump. It is an estimate, so check it.
  - Beep test: your level saves itself when you stop.
- Grip still needs a dynamometer.

